{"path":"experimental/fs/path/parent_path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::parent_path","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::filesystem::path::</span>parent_path","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/parent_path","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the path to the parent directory. Returns empty path if empty() or there's only a single element in the path (begin() == --end()).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path parent_path<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the path to the parent directory. Returns empty path if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">empty<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> or there's only a single element in the path (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"sy2\">--</span>end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>).\n</p><p>The resulting path is constructed by appending all elements in a range <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">--</span>end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code><code>)</code></span> to an empty path.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The path to the parent directory.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">path</span> p <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/var/tmp/example.txt\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"/\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"/var/tmp/.\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The parent path of \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">parent_path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The parent path of \"/var/tmp/example.txt\" is \"/var/tmp\"\nThe parent path of \"/\" is \"\"\nThe parent path of \"/var/tmp/.\" is \"/var/tmp\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete </div>\n<tr><td></td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"},{"path":"experimental/fs/path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::parent_path","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns the path to the parent directory."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The path to the parent directory."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":128,"codeBlockCount":2}
